CORE
main.sh
--show-parse-tree
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^    word lit"export"$
^    word lit"A=1"$
^    word lit"B"$
^    word dq\(param\(C\)\)$
^    word lit"D=" param\(x\)$
^    word lit"E="$
^    word lit"readonly"$
^    word lit"R=~/x"$
^    word lit"local"$
^    word lit"l=" param\(1\)$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
export and readonly are declaration utilities (POSIX.1-2024 XCU 2.9.1.1);
the tree must match the one of declaration-utilities (bash dialect).
